OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,6,Fmorning. Turning more showery in the
OL,7,Fafternoon, some of showers likely to
OL,8,Fbe on the heavier side across Lothian
OL,9,Fand the Borders.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy at first with some
OL,12,Fheavy showers in the east, these
OL,13,Ffading out through the evening. Mostly
OL,14,Fdry overnight but the odd light shower
OL,15,Fpossible over Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FDry in the east with some
OL,18,Fbright or sunny spells, cloudier with
OL,19,Fa few light showers in the west. More
OL,20,Fpersistent rain will spread into the
OL,21,Fwest later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
