OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fchangeable and often cloudy period
OL,7,Fwith occasional showers or longer
OL,8,Fspells of rain, possibly heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes, but generally drier in the
OL,10,Feast. Feeling warm in any sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
